@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = substitua-pelo-access-token
@organizationId = 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444
@executionId = exec-synthetic-complete

### Gerar relatório consolidado
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "report_type": "workorder_consolidated",
  "execution_id": "{{executionId}}",
  "organization_id": "{{organizationId}}",
  "reference_at": "2026-09-08T12:00:00Z",
  "filters": {"state": "consolidated"}
}

### Catálogo paginado
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?page=1&page_size=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Histórico (substitua o UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/versions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
